# Reproduce inc-ur9b: Surrender's lein message must receive its <num> amount.
# Before the fix __XPrint read past the supplied varargs.
#
#   INCURSION_OPTIONS=tools/fixtures/options-2026-08-22.dat \
#   INCURSION_LOAD=tools/fixtures/chars/kobold-rogue-seed1.sav \
#       tools/headless.sh tools/keys/surrender-lein-message.keys 2
#
# A hobgoblin has CR OPT_CR(1,1), so its lein is 750 under either option.

w
y
@choose "Monster Summoning"
@choose "Goblinkin"
@choose "hobgoblin"
RIGHT
ENTER

t
RIGHT
ENTER
s
y
@dump:lein
# The message area wraps between 750 and gold; read the full sentence in the log.
SPACE
v
@dump:lein-message
@quit
